 medicine."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"Miyuki"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["One I've never seen, so I don't know her name or appearance, and the other, who is the leader of the place, is a bat..."]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[1]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\n[1]"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["A bat... I think I know what she is."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"Pr_13_01",0,0,400,0,75,75,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"Miyuki"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Well, we call her Lady... but you'll soon find out her name. hehe"]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[1]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"Pr_3_01",0,0,400,0,75,75,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"Olivia"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Okay, okay, so what are we going to do? Staying here and being surrounded doesn't seem like a good plan to me."]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[1]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"\\n[1]"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Okay, let's do this: get ready, let's go to that house she mentioned... and we'll find out if it's a trap or not."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"Pr_6_01",0,0,600,0,75,75,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"Elizabeth"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Well, that's it, or we'll wait to be attacked. Everyone will be prepared, "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["love. Whenever you want to go, just talk to me."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"Elizabeth"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["What are you waiting for, my sweeties? Go get ready!"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,1,2,"everyone"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["ok!"]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[1]},{"code":201,"indent":0,"parameters":[0,208,31,9,0,0]},{"code":222,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code"